106
00:11:22.181 --> 00:11:23.432
<i>Aku harus pergi menerjemahkan.</i>

107
00:11:24.141 --> 00:11:24.975
Sendiri?

108
00:11:26.852 --> 00:11:28.270
<i>Aku akan pergi bersama sutradara.</i>

109
00:11:29.313 --> 00:11:32.149
<i>Juga, aku ingin terus bekerja.</i>

110
00:11:37.613 --> 00:11:39.615
<i>Ibumu menyuruhku berhenti,</i>

111
00:11:40.491 --> 00:11:42.368
<i>tapi saya ingin terus bekerja.</i>

112
00:11:50.793 --> 00:11:53.379
Kemudian jaga staf keamanan
